\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Directional cross-lens audit summary for SPT2018 vs SPT D1, with and without common-staging. The unprofiled audit uses direct evaluation of the test lens at the train lens's best-fit point; the profiled audit re-optimizes a tractable subset of test-lens nuisance parameters at fixed shared parameters (\cref  {sec:profiled-audit}). ``Common-staging'' restricts the D1 lens to the SPT2018 multipole support (\cref  {sec:common-staging}).}}{10}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:audit-summary}{{3}{10}{Directional cross-lens audit summary for SPT2018 vs SPT D1, with and without common-staging. The unprofiled audit uses direct evaluation of the test lens at the train lens's best-fit point; the profiled audit re-optimizes a tractable subset of test-lens nuisance parameters at fixed shared parameters (\cref {sec:profiled-audit}). ``Common-staging'' restricts the D1 lens to the SPT2018 multipole support (\cref {sec:common-staging})}{table.3}{}}
